    feat(node-local-persistent-volume): refuse startup on a broken volume pool, log not_composed when absent
    
    compose_volume_backing now separates the three probe outcomes: a backing passes
    through, no pool logs volume_backing.not_composed, and a failed probe logs
    health.startup.refused (reason volume_backing.probe) and returns the dedicated
    ControlPlaneError::VolumeBackingBoot. Adds VolumeProbeScenario::as_str.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Step-Id: 04-01
    Task-Id: node-local-persistent-volume

